This repository contains no NVIDIA code, weights or motion data.

Third-party components referenced at build or test time (not redistributed here):
- MotionBricks (NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES), https://github.com/NVlabs/motionbricks
  Code: Apache-2.0. Model weights (mmm_v6_soma_fp32.onnx, pinned by sha256 in
  SA.Inbetween.Contract.ModelPins): NVIDIA Open Model Agreement; obtain them from NVIDIA and
  keep their notices. Sample motions: evaluation and testing only; never shipped (see AGENTS.md
  and testdata/eval-only/README.md).
- ONNX Runtime (MIT), Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime: used by SA.Inbetween.Onnx and the CLI.
- xUnit.net v3 (Apache-2.0), CsCheck (Apache-2.0), Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers
  and Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.PublicApiAnalyzers (MIT): build and test only.

The engine embeds the 77-entry SOMA skeleton parent table (topology only, no motion or bind
data) so that results match the reference implementation.

Data formats are documented in docs/contract.md.
